---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-b from-steel-800 via-steel-900 to-steel-900"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 -z-10 h-96 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top,theme(colors.volt.500/15),transparent_60%)]"></div>
    <div class="container-wide pt-20 pb-24 md:pt-28 md:pb-32">
      <p class="eyebrow">501(c)(3) nonprofit · founded by working electricians</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold leading-[1.05]">
        AI for the Trades.<br>
        <span class="text-volt-500">Built by tradesmen, for tradesmen.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg text-steel-300">
        $242 billion went into AI last year. Zero reached the 10 million skilled workers who keep America running. We're changing that — by building tools tradesmen can actually use, teaching them the AI literacy they deserve, and defending their shops from AI-powered threats.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="/donate" class="btn-primary">Support the mission</a>
        <a href="/programs" class="btn-secondary">See what we're building →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-y border-steel-700/60 bg-steel-800/30">
    <div class="container-wide py-10 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <div>
        <div class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">$242B</div>
        <div class="mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-steel-400">invested in AI in 2024</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">$0</div>
        <div class="mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-steel-400">directed to the skilled trades</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">10M+</div>
        <div class="mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-steel-400">US tradesmen underserved</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">3:1</div>
        <div class="mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-steel-400">retirees to new tradespeople in NJ</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container-wide py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="eyebrow">Three pillars</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold">Build. Teach. Defend.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-steel-300">We don't do philanthropy <em>to</em> tradespeople — we do the work <em>with</em> them. Every tool we ship, every class we teach, every audit we run is pressure-tested in real shops.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <a href="/programs#build" class="card group relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-volt-500/20 to-transparent"></div>
        <div class="relative">
          <p class="eyebrow">BUILD</p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-bold">AI tools for trade work</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-steel-300">Truck Inventory, AI Estimator, Job-Site Companion. Voice-first, mobile-first, built for a grease-covered thumb in 40° weather.</p>
          <p class="mt-6 text-sm font-semibold text-volt-500 group-hover:text-volt-400">Learn more →</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="/programs#teach" class="card group relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-tradeblue-500/20 to-transparent"></div>
        <div class="relative">
          <p class="eyebrow">TEACH</p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-bold">Applied AI literacy</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-steel-300">Weekend workshops and a 4-week "AI-Ready Tradesman" certificate. Free tier for low-income tradesmen via grant subsidy.</p>
          <p class="mt-6 text-sm font-semibold text-volt-500 group-hover:text-volt-400">Learn more →</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="/programs#defend" class="card group relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500/20 to-transparent"></div>
        <div class="relative">
          <p class="eyebrow">DEFEND</p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-xl font-bold">Cybersecurity for small shops</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-steel-300">AI-threat audits, monthly monitoring, crew training. Protection against voice-cloning, phishing, and credential attacks.</p>
          <p class="mt-6 text-sm font-semibold text-volt-500 group-hover:text-volt-400">Learn more →</p>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container-wide py-16">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-steel-700/60 bg-gradient-to-br from-steel-800 to-steel-900 p-8 md:p-12">
      <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Why it matters</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold">Hope is not an inventory system.</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-steel-300">
            The tools tradespeople have been given to run their businesses are garbage. Clipboards, text threads, parts counts done from memory. Meanwhile the workforce is aging out — three retirees for every new tradesperson in NJ. We exist to close that gap with tools, training, and protection that actually work on a job site.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a href="/about" class="btn-secondary">Read our mission</a>
            <a href="/donate" class="btn-primary">Donate</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-steel-700/60 bg-steel-900/60 p-6">
          <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-volt-500 font-semibold">SROI</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold">$1 donated → $80–$160 in trade-worker value</p>
          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-steel-300">
            <li>• Hours saved per contractor per week</li>
            <li>• Jobs won through faster, accurate estimates</li>
            <li>• Shops hardened against AI-driven threats</li>
            <li>• Tradespeople certified in applied AI</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-steel-700/60 bg-gradient-to-br from-steel-900 via-steel-800/60 to-steel-900">
    <div class="container-wide py-14">
      <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1.2fr] md:items-center">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Stay in the loop</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold">Quarterly updates from the field.</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-steel-300 max-w-md">No spam. New tools, workshop dates, pilot results, and the occasional rant about clipboards. Unsubscribe whenever.</p>
        </div>
        <form name="newsletter" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field" action="/thanks" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
          <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="newsletter" />
          <p class="hidden"><label>Don't fill this out: <input name="bot-field" /></label></p>
          <input
            type="email"
            name="email"
            required
            placeholder="you@yourshop.com"
            class="flex-1 rounded-md border border-steel-700 bg-steel-900/80 px-4 py-3 text-steel-100 placeholder:text-steel-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-volt-500/60 focus:border-volt-500/60"
          />
          <button type="submit" class="btn-primary whitespace-nowrap">Subscribe</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
